674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jM_QhhCon38Q7kNvwFSVeBj&_nc_oc=AdoznmGAYxn3KBpWQB2-PC8XSOmn28H1W5uENCsm7uPxfMskBgENP7yg7pY25R4R770&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnP67RxwvyA0qLz-hT5R99FGkp3ADQShtUxdzD0B6nfw&oe=6AEB41D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tMUnfmSKRK0Q7kNvwFlWPGk&_nc_oc=AdorngVNY_A3MFWzJ4hvSjs0L2kiCdWNAFkMbsgLMETsJggla2QjbZNJ0F07nxRNQKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTGMi5gOZdeJ8w5ASVVi659t7XFoVbrw58M2P4y_TU9jg&oe=6AEB4A96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NNwXDPpff1EQ7kNvwHiP7Im&_nc_oc=AdqLDPShhpwbhfOmDIaF2vXjOTxY-mpuAE_jKJkw63Qwq79N9xPiv7Q77G0snbSLj5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjebIdbgVB6WTntxsrQFlrM6hHzUrvBKCrHJHO6tLjbA&oe=6AEB46B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip